<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.4.7">
<l>paruppatattuk kayalpoṟitta pāṇṭiyar kulapatipōl</l>
<l>tiruppolinta cēvaṭiyeñ ceṉṉiyiṉ mēlpoṟittāy</l>
<l>maruppocittāy mallaṭarttā yeṉṟeṉṟuṉ vācakamē</l>
<l>yuruppolinta nāviṉēṉai yuṉakkurit tākiṉaiyē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Like the patriarch of the Pāṇṭiyas</l>
<l rend="indent">who inscribed the Kayal fish on a mountain,</l>
<l>you have inscribed [your] beautiful,</l>
<l rend="indent">auspicious red feet on my head.</l>
<l>You have stripped me who has a tongue</l>
<l rend="indent"> that repeated copiously the words about you,</l>
<l>“You who broke the tusk! You who killed the wrestler!”</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] made [me] yours.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
